data: {"model_request":{"messages":[{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"reasoning_content":"现在立即调用render_algorithm。我需要构建完整的steps数组。让我一步步构建。\n\n首先，定义节点和边。我将为每一步提供graph对象。但render_algorithm的步骤中，graph对象只需要在第一步提供吗？实际上，根据文档，对于kind=\"graph\"，需要提供graph.nodes和graph.edges。可能每一步都需要提供完整的图信息，因为高亮显示会变化。但也许图结构是固定的，只需要在第一步提供，后续步骤可以引用？不过，为了安全起见，我可以在每一步都提供相同的节点和边，但更新高亮显示和队列。\n\n让我构建JSON结构。我将创建7个步骤。\n\n步骤1：初始化。\n步骤2：出队A，入队B和C。\n步骤3：出队B，入队D。\n步骤4：出队C，入队E。\n步骤5：出队D，入队F。\n步骤6：出队E，F已访问。\n步骤7：出队F，完成。\n\n在每一步中，我需要高亮显示当前节点、已访问节点和队列中的节点。队列中的节点可以用\"queued\"角色，已访问节点用\"visited\"角色，当前节点用\"current\"角色。\n\n另外，可能还需要显示遍历顺序。我可以在变量中显示。\n\n现在，让我构建render_algorithm的调用。我将使用中文描述。首先，定义节点坐标。我将使用归一化坐标。","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_6287ad974a07408ab2eba3d4","function":{"arguments":"{\"title\": \"BFS 遍历无向图\", \"description\": \"演示广度优先搜索（BFS）遍历无向图的过程，从节点 A 开始，展示队列、已访问节点、当前节点和遍历顺序。\", \"algorithm\": \"bfs\", \"steps\": [{\"description\": \"初始化：从节点 A 开始，将其加入队列并标记为已访问。\", \"annotation\": \"BFS 开始\", \"variables\": [{\"name\": \"队列\", \"value\": \"[A]\"}, {\"name\": \"已访问\", \"value\": \"{A}\"}, {\"name\": \"当前节点\", \"value\": \"A\"}, {\"name\": \"遍历顺序\", \"value\": \"[A]\"}], \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.8, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.7, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"F\", \"label\": \"F\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.95}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\"}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\"}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\"}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\"}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"F\"}, {\"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"F\"}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"current\"}], \"queue\": [\"A\"]}}, {\"description\": \"出队节点 A，探索其邻居 B 和 C。将 B 和 C 加入队列并标记为已访问。\", \"annotation\": \"探索 A 的邻居\", \"variables\": [{\"name\": \"队列\", \"value\": \"[B, C]\"}, {\"name\": \"已访问\", \"value\": \"{A, B, C}\"}, {\"name\": \"当前节点\", \"value\": \"B\"}, {\"name\": \"遍历顺序\", \"value\": \"[A, B, C]\"}], \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.8, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.7, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"F\", \"label\": \"F\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.95}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\"}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\"}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\"}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\"}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"F\"}, {\"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"F\"}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"queued\"}], \"queue\": [\"B\", \"C\"]}}, {\"description\": \"出队节点 B，探索其邻居 D。将 D 加入队列并标记为已访问。\", \"annotation\": \"探索 B 的邻居\", \"variables\": [{\"name\": \"队列\", \"value\": \"[C, D]\"}, {\"name\": \"已访问\", \"value\": \"{A, B, C, D}\"}, {\"name\": \"当前节点\", \"value\": \"C\"}, {\"name\": \"遍历顺序\", \"value\": \"[A, B, C, D]\"}], \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.8, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.7, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"F\", \"label\": \"F\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.95}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\"}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\"}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\"}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\"}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"F\"}, {\"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"F\"}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"queued\"}], \"queue\": [\"C\", \"D\"]}}, {\"description\": \"出队节点 C，探索其邻居 E。将 E 加入队列并标记为已访问。\", \"annotation\": \"探索 C 的邻居\", \"variables\": [{\"name\": \"队列\", \"value\": \"[D, E]\"}, {\"name\": \"已访问\", \"value\": \"{A, B, C, D, E}\"}, {\"name\": \"当前节点\", \"value\": \"D\"}, {\"name\": \"遍历顺序\", \"value\": \"[A, B, C, D, E]\"}], \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.8, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.7, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"F\", \"label\": \"F\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.95}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\"}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\"}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\"}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\"}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"F\"}, {\"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"F\"}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"role\": \"queued\"}], \"queue\": [\"D\", \"E\"]}}, {\"description\": \"出队节点 D，探索其邻居 F。将 F 加入队列并标记为已访问。\", \"annotation\": \"探索 D 的邻居\", \"variables\": [{\"name\": \"队列\", \"value\": \"[E, F]\"}, {\"name\": \"已访问\", \"value\": \"{A, B, C, D, E, F}\"}, {\"name\": \"当前节点\", \"value\": \"E\"}, {\"name\": \"遍历顺序\", \"value\": \"[A, B, C, D, E, F]\"}], \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.8, \"y\": 0.5}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.7, \"y\": 0.8}, {\"id\": \"F\", \"label\": \"F\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.95}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\"}, {\"from\": \"A\